  "details": "When sending warnings to players within an instance after opening up a player profile using the \"More Options\" menu found through the \"Three Dots\" menu (next to the reporting button on a user profile); the \"Warn User\" button doesn't provide a confirmation window to confirm if you would actually want to warn said player. This is inconsistent with the current \"Warn User\" button found through selecting a user after selecting a user capsule where that one does provide a confirmation box.\n\nSolution would be to restore consistency with providing a confirmation box, as the \"Kick User\" option from the \"More Options\" menu does provide this confirmation box as expected.",
